{"id":"wb-7-1513","name":"曼德拉山岩画群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"曼德拉山岩画群","text":"曼德拉山岩画群位于中国内蒙古自治区阿拉善盟阿拉善右旗曼德拉苏木境内的曼德拉山，以动物形象、狩猎和放牧等场景为主要内容，采用凿刻、磨刻和划刻等技法。山中已知岩画6000余幅，其中约18平方千米的核心分布区有4234幅经过普查建档。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9B%BC%E5%BE%B7%E6%8B%89%E5%B1%B1%E5%B2%A9%E7%94%BB%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":95427565,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95427565","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5c28c871629c9824f6c208c8.jpg","title":"Rock_Carving_on_Mt._Mandela.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rock_Carving_on_Mt._Mandela.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/Rock_Carving_on_Mt._Mandela.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Sjoerd van Oort","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"One of the hundreds of rock carving on Mt. Mandela located in the Badain Jaran Desert.","width":320,"height":213}}